    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Not only this",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something not only happens, but another thing also happens, use **-(으)ㄹ 뿐만 아니라**: 공부하다 → **공부할 뿐만 아니라** (not only studying, also…), 좋다 → **좋을 뿐만 아니라** (not only good, also…). With nouns: **N뿐만 아니라**.",
      "이 식당은 맛있**을 뿐만 아니라** 가격도 싸요 = this restaurant is not only tasty, it is also cheap."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Second part",
     "texto": [
      "The second part usually takes **-도** (also): 가격**도** 싸요.",
      "한국 음식**뿐만 아니라** 다른 음식도 많아요 = there is not only Korean food, there are also many other foods."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
